          <h3>Light commercial</h3>
          <p>Up to 600-amp 3-phase service. Tenant fit-outs, office retrofits, restaurant kitchens, small industrial. Our foreman Ray has 18 years of commercial experience and holds a Master's license; if we say we'll pass inspection on the first try, we mean it.</p>
          <p><strong>Scope:</strong> Every commercial project is bid fixed-price after a site walk. We don't play the T&amp;M game. If the drawings are incomplete, we say so before we bid.</p>
